# Copy to .env. Read by the Vite dev server and `vite build` from apps/console, at build time; it never
# reaches the Docker image (.dockerignore drops every .env). Each value lands in the client bundle, so no
# secrets here.
#
# Optional MapLibre style URL drawn under the campus plan. Unset: the offline plan only (zones, cameras,
# incidents on a plain ground), which is what on-prem and the Docker image run. The style must be reachable
# from the operator's browser; MapLibre's demo style works for a quick check:
# VITE_MAP_STYLE_URL=https://demotiles.maplibre.org/style.json
